# Gainz.fun Design System

## Color Palette

### Primary Colors

#### Electric Green (`#22FF88`)
- **Usage**: Gains, PnL, trading indicators
- **Tailwind Class**: `text-electric-green`, `bg-electric-green`, `border-electric-green`
- **Use Cases**:
  - Positive PnL values
  - Successful trades
  - Profit indicators
  - Trading success states

#### Deep Black (`#000000`)
- **Usage**: Premium elements + high contrast
- **Tailwind Class**: `text-deep-black`, `bg-deep-black`, `border-deep-black`
- **Use Cases**:
  - Premium UI elements
  - High contrast text/backgrounds
  - Emphasis elements

#### Solana Purple Gradient (`#9945FF` → `#14F195`)
- **Usage**: Chain identity, Solana-related features
- **Tailwind Classes**: 
  - `bg-solana-purple` (start: `#9945FF`)
  - `bg-solana-green` (end: `#14F195`)
- **Use Cases**:
  - Solana wallet connections
  - Chain-specific indicators
  - Blockchain identity elements
  - Gradient backgrounds: `bg-gradient-to-r from-solana-purple to-solana-green`

### Accent Colors

#### Cyber Yellow (`#F8F32B`)
- **Usage**: Alerts + notifications
- **Tailwind Class**: `text-cyber-yellow`, `bg-cyber-yellow`, `border-cyber-yellow`
- **Use Cases**:
  - Warning alerts
  - Important notifications
  - Attention-grabbing elements
  - Alert badges

#### Matrix Teal (`#0FE8D9`)
- **Usage**: AI + tech features
- **Tailwind Class**: `text-matrix-teal`, `bg-matrix-teal`, `border-matrix-teal`
- **Use Cases**:
  - AI-powered features
  - Tech indicators
  - Advanced functionality
  - AI chat/assistant elements

### Background Colors

#### Dark Mode Default (`#0A0A0A`)
- **Usage**: Main application background
- **Tailwind Class**: `bg-background`
- **Use Cases**:
  - Page backgrounds
  - Main container backgrounds
  - Default dark mode background

#### Soft Black (`#0F0F0F`)
- **Usage**: Component backgrounds
- **Tailwind Class**: `bg-background-soft`
- **Use Cases**:
  - Card backgrounds
  - Component containers
  - Elevated surfaces
  - Modal backgrounds

## Usage Examples

### Trading PnL Display
```tsx
<div className="text-electric-green font-bold">
  +$1,234.56
</div>
```

### Solana Wallet Connection
```tsx
<button className="bg-gradient-to-r from-solana-purple to-solana-green text-white px-4 py-2 rounded">
  Connect Solana Wallet
</button>
```

### Alert Notification
```tsx
<div className="bg-cyber-yellow text-deep-black px-4 py-2 rounded">
  ⚠️ High volatility detected
</div>
```

### AI Feature Indicator
```tsx
<div className="text-matrix-teal flex items-center gap-2">
  <SparklesIcon /> AI Trading Assistant
</div>
```

### Component Card
```tsx
<div className="bg-background-soft border border-electric-green/20 rounded-lg p-6">
  {/* Card content */}
</div>
```

## Tailwind Utility Classes Reference

### Text Colors
- `text-electric-green` - Electric Green (#22FF88)
- `text-deep-black` - Deep Black (#000000)
- `text-solana-purple` - Solana Purple (#9945FF)
- `text-solana-green` - Solana Green (#14F195)
- `text-cyber-yellow` - Cyber Yellow (#F8F32B)
- `text-matrix-teal` - Matrix Teal (#0FE8D9)
- `text-foreground` - Default text color (#EDEDED)
- `text-background` - Background color as text (#0A0A0A)

### Background Colors
- `bg-electric-green` - Electric Green (#22FF88)
- `bg-deep-black` - Deep Black (#000000)
- `bg-solana-purple` - Solana Purple (#9945FF)
- `bg-solana-green` - Solana Green (#14F195)
- `bg-cyber-yellow` - Cyber Yellow (#F8F32B)
- `bg-matrix-teal` - Matrix Teal (#0FE8D9)
- `bg-background` - Main background (#0A0A0A)
- `bg-background-soft` - Soft component background (#0F0F0F)

### Border Colors
- `border-electric-green` - Electric Green border
- `border-deep-black` - Deep Black border
- `border-solana-purple` - Solana Purple border
- `border-solana-green` - Solana Green border
- `border-cyber-yellow` - Cyber Yellow border
- `border-matrix-teal` - Matrix Teal border

### Gradients
- `bg-gradient-to-r from-solana-purple to-solana-green` - Solana identity gradient
- `bg-gradient-to-br from-solana-purple to-solana-green` - Diagonal Solana gradient

## Design Principles

1. **Dark-First**: All backgrounds use dark colors (#0A0A0A, #0F0F0F)
2. **High Contrast**: Use Deep Black (#000000) for premium, high-contrast elements
3. **Semantic Colors**: Colors have specific meanings (green = gains, yellow = alerts, teal = AI)
4. **Chain Identity**: Solana gradient used for blockchain-related features
5. **Accessibility**: Ensure sufficient contrast ratios for text readability

